window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I walked away from Ashe to save his life, but coming back means facing a vampire who’s more possessive, more relentless, and more determined to make me his—no matter the cost.</p> <p>I made a deal with a demon to save Ashe’s life, but the price was high—my freedom, my body, and a century and a half of separation from the vampire I once called mine. Now, I’m back, and fate has thrown us together again. Ashe is still the same—intense, possessive, and dangerously determined to claim what he believes is his. But it’s not that simple. The wounds of our past run deep, and the demon inside me is a constant reminder of the sacrifice I made. I want to redeem our love, to prove we’re still fated mates. But earning his trust again won’t be easy, and the darkness we face this time threatens to destroy everything—unless we can find a way to forgive the past and fight for our future.</p> <p><i>Vampire Runner</i> is Book 4 in the Nightshade Vampires, a paranormal romance series featuring a vampire mafia clan. It can be listened to on its own and does not end on a cliffhanger. However, like most series, it is best listened to in order.</p>"; 
